{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "26", "m": "08", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "04", "M": "28", "S": "29"}}, "news": [{"title": "Gurugram: DTCP cancels another project licence of Ocean Seven Buildtech", "para": "The town planning department of Gurgaon has revoked another project license belonging to Ocean Seven Buildtech due to ongoing construction delays and regulatory breaches. As a result, the purchasers of OSB Golf Heights are now left in a state of uncertainty regarding the project's future. Furthermore, the department has assumed control of the colony, hinting at potential additional actions.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/regulatory/gurugram-dtcp-cancels-another-project-licence-of-ocean-seven-buildtech/133529374?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-226144/133529374.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "regulatory"}, {"title": "Provisional booking no basis for allottee status: Haryana RERA junks plea", "para": "According to the Haryana RERA ruling, merely having a provisional allotment is insufficient to establish a promoter-allottee status. As a result, the complaint against Eldeco and HSIIDC was dismissed. The complainant did not sign or register the sale agreement, despite reminders. Eldeco confirmed its offer was withdrawn with a full refund, while HSIIDC reiterated that the plot allotment was conducted on an 'as is where is' basis.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/rera/provisional-booking-no-basis-for-allottee-status-haryana-rera-junks-plea/133529194?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-52312/133529194.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "rera"}, {"title": "Telangana RERA fines Chabbras Bentley Woods promoter for unregistered sales", "para": "Telangana RERA imposed a hefty fine of nearly one crore rupees on a developer for the unlawful sale of unregistered villas. The regulatory body has mandated a refund of twenty lakh rupees to an aggrieved buyer within a month. The developer, Chabbras Bentley Woods, misrepresented its project as a villa offering despite being registered only for plots.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/rera/telangana-rera-fines-chabbras-bentley-woods-promoter-for-unregistered-sales/133529172?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-87394/133529172.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "rera"}]}